LAMMPS (7 Feb 2024 - Update 1)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# soapff-cui: ClayFF + SOAP charges.  lmp -in in.lammps
include system.settings
# soapff-cui settings: ClayFF (Cygan et al. 2004, Tables 1 and 2) with flexible SPC water; charges in system.data come from SOAP
units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 10.0
pair_modify mix arithmetic tail no
special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.0
read_data system.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (20.706 17.9744 19.970797) with tilt (0 -2.0130661 0)
  2 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  672 atoms
  scanning bonds ...
  1 = max bonds/atom
  scanning angles ...
  2 = max angles/atom
  reading bonds ...
  64 bonds
  reading angles ...
  128 angles
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     1 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     0 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
     0 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
     1 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.004 seconds
pair_coeff 1 1 1.3298e-06 4.27124  # ao
pair_coeff 2 2 1.8405e-06 3.30203  # at
pair_coeff 3 3 0 0  # ho
pair_coeff 4 4 0.1 3.33401  # K
pair_coeff 5 5 0.1554 3.16554  # ob
pair_coeff 6 6 0.1554 3.16554  # obts
pair_coeff 7 7 0.1554 3.16554  # oh
pair_coeff 8 8 1.8405e-06 3.30203  # st
bond_coeff 1 554.1349 1.0  # O-H
angle_coeff 1 30.0 109.47  # MOH-Al-bulk
kspace_style pppm 1.0e-5
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol density lx ly lz
thermo 1000
# minimisation with a small step limit first (built structures may contain overlapping water)
min_style cg
min_modify dmax 0.01
minimize 1.0e-4 1.0e-6 1000 10000
